%description:
Tests a timeout with a probe of the path MTU search in flight (mtuProbing = 2,
SACK, frtoEnabled). The scenario is that of tcp_mtu_probe_1, but the tester
deletes the probe B021 (MTU 1026) and each segment after it up to B039, so no
duplicate ACK comes, and the retransmission timer expires at 2.021 s. As Linux
tcp_enter_loss(), F-RTO does not start with a probe in flight, and the
retransmission B040 ends the probe without a result (__tcp_retransmit_skb()):
the bounds of the search stay, so after the recovery a new probe of MTU 1026
gets through and raises the MSS to 986.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 5s
*.srv_app.sendScript="1.0 40000"
*.srv_tcp.mss = 600
*.cli_tcp.mss = 1460
*.*_tcp.delayedAcksEnabled = false
*.srv_tcp.mtuProbing = 2
*.srv_tcp.baseMss = 512
*.srv_tcp.pathMtu = 1500
*.srv_tcp.frtoEnabled = true
*.*_tcp.sackSupport = true
*.tcptester.script="b21 delete; b22 delete; b23 delete; b24 delete; b25 delete; b26 delete; b27 delete; b28 delete; b29 delete; b30 delete; b31 delete; b32 delete; b33 delete; b34 delete; b35 delete; b36 delete; b37 delete; b38 delete; b39 delete"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.017 B021] A.1000 < B.2000: A 11901:12887(986) ack 1 win 16384 # deleting
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[2.021 B040] A.1000 < B.2000: A 11901:12501(600) ack 1 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
F-RTO: no detection, an MTU probe is in flight
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
RFC 4821: a retransmission ends the MTU probe of 1026 without a result
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
RFC 4821: the MTU probe of 1026 is acknowledged, snd_mss is 986, the search runs from 1026 to 1500
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%not-contains: stdout
RFC 4821: the MTU probe of 1026 is lost
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
